You can always drop the bag and #loot it - be waned however that a cursed
BoH eats some items each time it is used. Pray that it does not eat your
remove curse scrolls :-) And yes, a normal and blessed BoH decresaes the 
weight of items in it - while a cursed one increases it.
  ANd this not not a way of avoiding victory - it is just a way to teach you
always to carry your survival kit (remove curse, holy water and some food)
in a sack (oilskin is best)... Also carrying a BoH in a sack might not be a
bad idea once you killed the wizard and get those random curses. It is more
work to retrieve stuff - but it is safe...
